WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,460
It's not that I have a good relationship with Eyemask Silk

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,820
It’s Chen Haoyu

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,620
The disciple did win Chen Haoyu

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,460
But this guy’s trump card is a bit weird

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,660
There was a fork

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,860
Now I share a body with him

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,940
Most of the time I am in control of my physical body

8
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,460
But he comes out occasionally

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,860
Ding Xin'er took the initiative to recruit him as a role model before

10
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,460
The disciple pretended to be Chen Haoyu and accepted the other party's request

11
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,620
Actively lurking around Qianjizi

12
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:27,630
So now I am also a model of eye mask silk.

13
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:30,690
Fortunately you didn't lie to me

14
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:33,650
This true eye can explore your past

15
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,340
If what I’m telling you is interesting, right?

16
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,340
Will want to move

17
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:41,360
Then I can only bear the pain and kill me

18
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:44,120
The cutest little lion

19
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:50,150
Why don't you reply to the master who sent soul silk to order me?
